# ACCESS SCOPE

RBAC = what the user may do.
ABAC = which resource they may do it to.

Examples:
Principal → permitted school only.
School Admin → permitted school only.
Correspondent → permitted school only.
Teacher → assigned branch/class/section/subject only.
Management/Director → explicitly permitted schools only.
Transport Manager → permitted school/transport scope.
Student → own authorized data only.

Never authorize because an ID exists.

A valid Student ID from another school is still unauthorized.
